  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting and Empowering girls to reach their ful  Imprest Request No. 13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to reduce adolescent pregnancy in Sierra Leone. The objectives of the project are: (1) strengthen national mechanisms for the reduction of adolescent pregnancy and child marriage; (2) strengthen capacity of GBV service providers to respond to adolescent survivors of GBV; (3) strengthen capacity of Sierra Leone&apos;s Ministry of Basic Secondary School Education (MBSSE) to deliver comprehensive sexuality education and Radical Inclusion and (4) adolescents have increased access to life skills information, including on SRHR and GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
